<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>UTM Tag Builder — Free Campaign URL Generator</title>
<meta name="description" content="Build clean, trackable UTM campaign URLs in seconds. Free, no sign-up, works entirely in your browser. Save your last links and copy them instantly.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🏷️</text></svg>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#EFEAE0;
    --paper-raised:#F7F4EC;
    --ink:#1C2320;
    --ink-soft:#5B5F57;
    --line:#C9C2B0;
    --stamp:#B23A2E;
    --stamp-dark:#8E2C22;
    --ok:#3D6B4C;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .wrap{
    max-width:640px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:64px 24px 80px;
  }
  header{
    margin-bottom:40px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    color:var(--stamp);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:7px;height:7px;
    background:var(--stamp);
    border-radius:50%;
    display:inline-block;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-optical-sizing:auto;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,44px);
    line-height:1.12;
    margin:0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  header p{
    max-width:46ch;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:15.5px;
    margin:0;
  }

  .card{
    background:var(--paper-raised);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:3px;
    padding:28px;
    margin-bottom:28px;
  }

  .field{
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .field:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  .field label{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:baseline;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:500;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .field label .req{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-weight:400;
  }
  .field input{
    width:100%;
    padding:11px 12px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:2px;
    background:#fff;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .field input:focus{
    outline:none;
    border-color:var(--stamp);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(178,58,46,0.12);
  }
  .field .hint{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top:5px;
  }

  .row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:16px;
  }
  @media (max-width:480px){
    .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }

  .optional-toggle{
    background:none;
    border:none;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    cursor:pointer;
    padding:4px 0;
    text-decoration:underline;
    text-underline-offset:3px;
  }
  .optional-fields{
    display:none;
    margin-top:18px;
    padding-top:18px;
    border-top:1px dashed var(--line);
  }
  .optional-fields.open{display:block;}

  /* --- tag / label output --- */
  .tag{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--paper-raised);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:3px;
    padding:24px 24px 20px;
  }
  .tag::before,.tag::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0; right:0;
    height:0;
    border-top:1.5px dashed var(--line);
  }
  .tag::before{top:0;}
  .tag::after{bottom:0;}
  .tag-label{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .tag-url{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:13.5px;
    line-height:1.6;
    word-break:break-all;
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:14px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    min-height:24px;
  }
  .tag-url .base{color:var(--ink);}
  .tag-url .param-key{color:var(--stamp-dark);}
  .tag-url .param-val{color:var(--ink);}
  .tag-url .sep{color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .tag-url.empty{color:var(--ink-soft); font-style:italic;}

  .actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:10px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  button.copy{
    background:var(--stamp);
    color:#fff;
    border:none;
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:10px 18px;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:13.5px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:background 0.15s ease;
  }
  button.copy:hover{background:var(--stamp-dark);}
  button.copy:disabled{background:var(--line); cursor:not-allowed;}
  .copied-msg{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--ok);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    opacity:0;
    transition:opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .copied-msg.show{opacity:1;}

  /* --- history --- */
  .history{
    margin-top:8px;
  }
  .history h2{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin:0 0 12px;
    text-transform:none;
  }
  .history-item{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    padding:12px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:13px;
  }
  .history-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .history-item .hurl{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    word-break:break-all;
    flex:1;
  }
  .history-item button{
    flex-shrink:0;
    background:none;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:5px 10px;
    font-size:11.5px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    cursor:pointer;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .history-item button:hover{border-color:var(--stamp);}
  .history-empty{
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:13px;
    font-style:italic;
  }

  footer{
    margin-top:48px;
    padding-top:24px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:16px;
  }
  footer p{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin:0;
    max-width:32ch;
  }
  .coffee-btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:#fff !important;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:10px 16px;
    border-radius:2px;
    font-size:13.5px;
    font-weight:500;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    white-space:nowrap;
    transition:background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .coffee-btn:hover{background:#000;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">FREE &middot; NO SIGN-UP &middot; RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER</div>
    <h1>Tag every link before you ship it.</h1>
    <p>Build a clean UTM campaign URL, copy it, and move on. Nothing is uploaded anywhere — this page works entirely on your device.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="url">Destination URL <span class="req">required</span></label>
      <input type="text" id="url" placeholder="https://yoursite.com/landing-page">
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="source">Campaign source <span class="req">required</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="source" placeholder="newsletter, twitter, google">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="medium">Campaign medium <span class="req">required</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="medium" placeholder="email, social, cpc">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="campaign">Campaign name <span class="req">required</span></label>
      <input type="text" id="campaign" placeholder="spring_launch, black_friday">
    </div>

    <button class="optional-toggle" id="toggleOptional" type="button">+ Add term &amp; content (optional)</button>

    <div class="optional-fields" id="optionalFields">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="term">Campaign term</label>
          <input type="text" id="term" placeholder="running+shoes">
          <div class="hint">Used for paid search keywords</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="content">Campaign content</label>
          <input type="text" id="content" placeholder="top_banner, sidebar_ad">
          <div class="hint">Differentiate similar links/ads</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tag">
    <div class="tag-label">YOUR TAGGED URL</div>
    <div class="tag-url empty" id="output">Fill in the fields above to generate your link</div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="copy" id="copyBtn" disabled>Copy link</button>
      <span class="copied-msg" id="copiedMsg">Copied to clipboard</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card history" style="margin-top:28px;">
    <h2>Recent links</h2>
    <div id="historyList"><div class="history-empty">Links you generate will be saved here on this device.</div></div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>Built as a small free tool. If it saved you time, a coffee is always appreciated.</p>
    <a class="coffee-btn" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/aiforwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener">☕ Buy me a coffee</a>
  </footer>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);
  const urlEl = $('url'), sourceEl = $('source'), mediumEl = $('medium'),
        campaignEl = $('campaign'), termEl = $('term'), contentEl = $('content');
  const output = $('output'), copyBtn = $('copyBtn'), copiedMsg = $('copiedMsg');
  const historyList = $('historyList');
  const STORAGE_KEY = 'utm_tag_builder_history';

  $('toggleOptional').addEventListener('click', function(){
    const el = $('optionalFields');
    const isOpen = el.classList.toggle('open');
    this.textContent = isOpen ? '− Hide term & content' : '+ Add term & content (optional)';
  });

  function buildUrl(){
    const base = urlEl.value.trim();
    const params = [
      ['utm_source', sourceEl.value.trim()],
      ['utm_medium', mediumEl.value.trim()],
      ['utm_campaign', campaignEl.value.trim()],
      ['utm_term', termEl.value.trim()],
      ['utm_content', contentEl.value.trim()]
    ].filter(p => p[1].length > 0);

    if(!base || params.length === 0) return null;

    let separator = base.includes('?') ? '&' : '?';
    let full = base;
    const parts = [];
    params.forEach(([k,v]) => {
      parts.push(k + '=' + encodeURIComponent(v));
    });
    full += separator + parts.join('&');
    return { full, base, params };
  }

  function render(){
    const result = buildUrl();
    if(!result){
      output.textContent = 'Fill in the fields above to generate your link';
      output.classList.add('empty');
      copyBtn.disabled = true;
      return;
    }
    output.classList.remove('empty');
    let html = '<span class="base">' + escapeHtml(result.base) + '</span>';
    result.params.forEach((p, i) => {
      html += '<span class="sep">' + (i === 0 ? '?' : '&amp;') + '</span>';
      html += '<span class="param-key">' + escapeHtml(p[0]) + '</span>';
      html += '<span class="sep">=</span>';
      html += '<span class="param-val">' + escapeHtml(encodeURIComponent(p[1])) + '</span>';
    });
    output.innerHTML = html;
    copyBtn.disabled = false;
  }

  function escapeHtml(str){
    const d = document.createElement('div');
    d.textContent = str;
    return d.innerHTML;
  }

  [urlEl, sourceEl, mediumEl, campaignEl, termEl, contentEl].forEach(el=>{
    el.addEventListener('input', render);
  });

  copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
    const result = buildUrl();
    if(!result) return;
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(result.full).then(()=>{
      copiedMsg.classList.add('show');
      setTimeout(()=> copiedMsg.classList.remove('show'), 1800);
      saveToHistory(result.full);
    });
  });

  function loadHistory(){
    try{
      const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
      return raw ? JSON.parse(raw) : [];
    }catch(e){ return []; }
  }

  function saveToHistory(url){
    let hist = loadHistory();
    hist = hist.filter(u => u !== url);
    hist.unshift(url);
    hist = hist.slice(0, 5);
    try{ localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(hist)); }catch(e){}
    renderHistory();
  }

  function renderHistory(){
    const hist = loadHistory();
    if(hist.length === 0){
      historyList.innerHTML = '<div class="history-empty">Links you generate will be saved here on this device.</div>';
      return;
    }
    historyList.innerHTML = hist.map(u => {
      const safe = escapeHtml(u);
      return '<div class="history-item"><div class="hurl">' + safe + '</div>' +
             '<button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.parentElement.querySelector(\'.hurl\').textContent)">Copy</button></div>';
    }).join('');
  }

  render();
  renderHistory();
})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
# UTM Tag Builder

A free, no-sign-up UTM campaign URL builder. Runs entirely in the browser — nothing is sent to a server.

**Live demo:** _(add your GitHub Pages link here once deployed)_

## Features
- Build UTM-tagged URLs (source, medium, campaign, term, content)
- Live preview with syntax highlighting
- One-click copy
- Saves your last 5 links locally (on your device only — no account, no database)
- Support link: [Buy me a coffee](https://buymeacoffee.com/aiforwork)

## Tech
Plain HTML/CSS/JS. No build step, no dependencies, no backend.

## Deploying on GitHub Pages
1. Push this repo to GitHub.
2. Go to **Settings → Pages**.
3. Under "Build and deployment," set **Source: Deploy from a branch**.
4. Branch: `main`, folder: `/ (root)`. Save.
5. Your site will be live at `https://<your-username>.github.io/<repo-name>/` within a minute or two.

